<% if (_status === 'scheduled') { %>
Inspection Scheduled
====================

Hi <%= currentuser.firstName %>,

A <%= inspectionType %> inspection has been scheduled for your unit.
You are responsible for conducting this inspection by walking through each room, rating the condition of items, and uploading photos as evidence.

DETAILS
-------
Reference #:    <%= iuid %>
Type:           <%= inspectionType %>
Scheduled Date: <%= scheduledDate %>

WHAT YOU NEED TO DO
-------------------
1. Log in to your tenant portal and open this inspection
2. Walk through each room and rate the condition of every item
3. Take at least 2 photos per room where you find any damage or issues
4. Add notes describing any problems you observe
5. Submit the inspection when all rooms are complete

Photos are required for any room with damage. Please ensure images are clear and show the full extent of any issues found.
<% } else if (_status === 'submitted') { %>
Inspection Report Submitted
============================

Hi <%= currentuser.firstName %>,

A <%= inspectionType %> inspection report has been submitted and is now available for your review.

DETAILS
-------
Reference #: <%= iuid %>
Type:        <%= inspectionType %>

Please review the report at your earliest convenience. If you have any concerns,
you may dispute the findings through the portal.
<% } else if (_status === 'approved') { %>
Inspection Approved
====================

Hi <%= currentuser.firstName %>,

<% if (hasRefund && refundAmount > 0) { %>Your inspection has been approved. A refund of <%= (refundAmount / 100).toLocaleString(undefined, { style: 'currency', currency: currency || 'USD' }) %> out of your <%= (depositAmount / 100).toLocaleString(undefined, { style: 'currency', currency: currency || 'USD' }) %> security deposit will be processed.
<% } else if (hasRefund) { %>Your inspection has been approved. No security deposit refund will be issued.
<% } else { %>Your inspection has been approved. No further action is required.
<% } %>

DETAILS
-------
Reference #: <%= iuid %>
Status:      Approved
<% if (hasRefund) { %>Deposit Refund: <%= ((refundAmount || 0) / 100).toLocaleString(undefined, { style: 'currency', currency: currency || 'USD' }) %>
<% } %>
<% } else if (_status === 'rejected') { %>
<%= isFinal ? 'Inspection Rejected' : 'Inspection Needs Revision' %>
============================

Hi <%= currentuser.firstName %>,

<% if (isFinal) { %>Your inspection has been reviewed and rejected. Please contact your property manager for next steps.
<% } else { %>Your inspection report requires revision before it can be finalized.
<% } %>

DETAILS
-------
Reference #: <%= iuid %>
Status:      <%= isFinal ? 'Rejected' : 'Revision Required' %>
Reason:      <%= reason %>
<% } else if (_status === 'cancelled') { %>
Inspection Cancelled
=====================

Hi <%= currentuser.firstName %>,

A previously scheduled inspection has been cancelled. No action is required on your part.
If you have questions, please contact your property manager.

DETAILS
-------
Reference #: <%= iuid %>
Status:      Cancelled
<% } %>
